# Format Before Commit

Before creating a commit, always format changed code files.

## Required

- Run formatter commands for the files you changed.
- If a language formatter is available, prefer it over manual whitespace edits.
- Re-run formatting if subsequent edits are made before commit.

## Commands for this repository

```bash
dart format <changed-dart-files>
```

For broad formatting when needed:

```bash
dart format .
```

## Commit readiness

Do not create a commit until formatting has been applied to the changed files.
